Package: loopQTL
Title: Anchor-Restricted Loop QTL Mapping from Hi-C
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(person("Rhie Lab at the University of Southern California", email = "rhielab@gmail.com", role = "cre"), person("Zexun", "Wu", role = "aut", email = "zexunwu@usc.edu"))
Description: Maps chromatin loop QTLs by testing whether genotype at a loop's
    anchors associates with the loop's contact strength across samples. Reads
    .hic files via strawr, builds an exact-coordinate consensus loop set,
    normalizes contact strength across samples via band-wise quantile
    normalization in the style of BNBC (implemented on top of
    preprocessCore), and runs anchor-restricted SNP-by-loop regressions with
    MatrixEQTL. Intra-chromosomal loops only; no FDR or lead-SNP selection
    (left to the user).
URL: https://github.com/rhielab/loopQTL
BugReports: https://github.com/rhielab/loopQTL/issues
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
